00:16:13.845 --> 00:16:15.205
Trust, as you might know,

00:16:16.245 --> 00:16:24.405
operates in approximately 14 towns in the area. We haven't been that active in Andover in the past, but we did get the opportunity

00:16:24.405 --> 00:16:28.980
earlier this year to acquire 32 acres of property on Skinner Hill Road.

00:16:30.180 --> 00:16:36.660
