00:16:37.460 --> 00:16:39.140
And they spun it off to us

00:16:39.565 --> 00:16:45.965
really because they wanted to focus on their specific area, which is Manchester, and Joshua's Trust is much more regional.

00:16:46.525 --> 00:16:49.645
